# Engineering Standards (REPO-SPECIFIC — edit this file)

The main agent loads this skill when it matches the description above. Keep it
repo-specific and actionable; put always-true rules in AGENTS.md instead.

## When to use

- Client ↔ server contract changes (endpoints, request/response shapes, error codes)
- Auth & session boundaries, token handling, sensitive data
- Data models, serialization/nullability, async lifecycle
- Adding or changing tests; before asking wai to review

